ac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=5,\\qquad \\mathrm{d}x=\\left(\\frac{1}{5}\\right)\\mathrm{d}u.\n$$\n\nTransform both bounds using the same substitution:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=\\frac{3 \\pi}{10}&\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad u=5\\left(\\frac{3 \\pi}{10}\\right)+\\left(0\\right)=\\frac{3 \\pi}{2}\\\\ x=\\frac{2 \\pi}{5}&\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad u=5\\left(\\frac{2 \\pi}{5}\\right)+\\left(0\\right)=2 \\pi.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstitute and integrate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{\\frac{3 \\pi}{10}}^{\\frac{2 \\pi}{5}} 6\\cos\\left(5 x\\right)\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\ &=6\\left(\\frac{1}{5}\\right)\\int_{\\frac{3 \\pi}{2}}^{2 \\pi} \\cos\\left(u\\right)\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\\\ &=\\frac{6}{5}\\int_{\\frac{3 \\pi}{2}}^{2 \\pi} \\cos\\left(u\\right)\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\\\ &=\\frac{6}{5}\\left[\\sin\\left(u\\right)\\right]_{\\frac{3 \\pi}{2}}^{2 \\pi}\\\\ &=\\frac{6}{5}\\left(\\sin\\left(2 \\pi\\right)-\\sin\\left(\\frac{3 \\pi}{2}\\right)\\right)\\\\ &=\\frac{6}{5}\\left(\\left(0\\right)-\\left(-1\\right)\\right)\\\\ &=\\frac{6}{5}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "11bb5810-8fd4-5240-816a-1e0045d47db7" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "11bb5810-8fd4-5240-816a-1e0045d47db7" :question/answer-fields "491e09d7-9878-549c-9953-02aa1c05a5b0"] [:db/ensure "11bb5810-8fd4-5240-816a-1e0045d47db7" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions "11bb5810-8fd4-5240-816a-1e0045d47db7"] [:db/add "e264be86-492d-555e-b3b6-d506cc7faafa" :answer/id #uuid "e264be86-492d-555e-b3b6-d506cc7faafa"] [:db/add "e264be86-492d-555e-b3b6-d506cc7faafa" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "e264be86-492d-555e-b3b6-d506cc7faafa" :answer/value "\\frac{4}{3}"] [:db/ensure "e264be86-492d-555e-b3b6-d506cc7faafa" :answer/validate] [:db/add "4391081d-d9d8-53a8-901c-23dfa8a391b6" :answer/id #uuid "4391081d-d9d8-53a8-901c-23dfa8a391b6"] [:db/add "4391081d-d9d8-53a8-901c-23dfa8a391b6" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "4391081d-d9d8-53a8-901c-23dfa8a391b6" :answer/v