:db/ensure "8c747eea-34fe-5f67-8f02-1bbde55c0a0a" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "8b55ce3b-54d2-5872-9ccd-0fcc112b2251" :question/id #uuid "8b55ce3b-54d2-5872-9ccd-0fcc112b2251"] [:db/add "8b55ce3b-54d2-5872-9ccd-0fcc112b2251" :question/problem "Evaluate the integral. Give an exact answer.\n\n$$\n\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{12}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{6}} 8\\sin\\left(6 x\\right)\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$"] [:db/add "8b55ce3b-54d2-5872-9ccd-0fcc112b2251" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=6 x.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=6,\\qquad \\mathrm{d}x=\\left(\\frac{1}{6}\\right)\\mathrm{d}u.\n$$\n\nTransform both bounds using the same substitution:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=\\frac{\\pi}{12}&\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad u=6\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{12}\\right)+\\left(0\\right)=\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\\\ x=\\frac{\\pi}{6}&\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad u=6\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)+\\left(0\\right)=\\pi.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstitute and integrate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{12}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{6}} 8\\sin\\left(6 x\\right)\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\ &=8\\left(\\frac{1}{6}\\right)\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}^{\\pi} \\sin\\left(u\\right)\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\\\ &=\\frac{4}{3}\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}^{\\pi} \\sin\\left(u\\right)\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\\\ &=\\frac{4}{3}\\left[-\\cos\\left(u\\right)\\right]_{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}^{\\pi}\\\\ &=- \\frac{4}{3}\\left(\\cos\\left(\\pi\\right)-\\cos\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right)\\right)\\\\ &=- \\frac{4}{3}\\left(\\left(-1\\right)-\\left(0\\right)\\right)\\\\ &=\\frac{4}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "8b55ce3b-54d2-5872-9ccd-0fcc112b2251" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "8b55ce3b-54d2-5872-9ccd-0fcc112b2251" :question/answer-fields "8c747eea-34fe-5f67-8f02-1bbde55c0a0a"] [:db/ensure "8b55ce3b-54d2-5872-9ccd-0fcc112b2251" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions "8b55ce3b-54d2-5872-9ccd-0fcc112b2251"] [:db/add "7c0ac9ed-aa36-5cd6-b857-f98fa492f0ad" :answer/id #uuid "7c0ac9ed-aa36-5cd6-b857-f98fa492f0ad"] [:d